  "description": "Installation of FD30 rated fire doors and fire resistant partitions within several flats to achieve protected means of escape. Removal of gallerias and replacement with fire rated walls. Decommissioning of basement in Flat 84 (Flat 2) from habitable use due to flooding; relocation of bathroom and kitchen to ground floor. Installation of conservation style rooflight on rear roof slope above staircase to provide 1.0m² AOV smoke ventilation in accordance with fire strategy.",
